        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Sari, white cotton with woven check design, red silk side borders with a smaller or minor inside border of gold-wrapped thread motifs. The pallu at one end with horizontal bands of metal (gold or silver gilt)-wrapped thread. A single narrow band of gold-wrapped thread and red silk at the other end. Pieces cut out along the length of the sari. Red circular stamp with lion motif in the field."@en ;
